,"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018","book_id":"b-jinshu-037","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p010","text":"湣帝之蒙塵也，保自稱晉王。時上邽大饑，士眾窘困，張春奉保之南安。陳安自號秦州刺史，稱籓于劉曜。春復奉保奔桑城，將投于張寔。寔使兵迎保，實禦之也。是歲，保病薨，時年二十七。保體質豐偉，嘗自稱重八百斤。喜睡，痿疾，不能禦婦人。無子，張春立宗室司馬瞻奉保後。陳安舉兵攻春，春走，瞻降于安，安送詣劉曜，曜殺之。安迎保喪，以天子禮葬于上邽，諡曰元。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","voice_scope":"史臣敘事","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p010:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"湣帝","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAIAND","status":"contextual_provisional","source_identity_role":"min","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin037-gaomi-nanyang/identity-readings.json#min"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p010:m0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"保","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADBDA","status":"contextual_provisional","source_identity_role":"bao","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin037-gaomi-nanyang/identity-readings.json#bao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p010:m0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"張春","kind":"person","person_id":"qfa_gs9_fjn","status":"contextual_provisional","source_identity_role":"zhangchun","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin037-gaomi-nanyang/identity-readings.json#zhangchun"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p010:m0027","start":27,"end":28,"surface":"保","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAADBDA","status":"contextual_provisional","source_identity_role":"bao","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin037-gaomi-nanyang/identity-readings.json#bao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws2630018:p010:m0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"陳安","kind":"person","person_id":"y7d_n39_1u4","status":"contextual_provisional","source_identity_role":"chenan","identity_reading_ref":"source-evidence/jin037-gaomi-nanyang/identity-readings.json#chenan"},{"id":"c-jinshu-037-gaomi-nanyang-ws26300